", "verdict": "clean", "reason": "libs.py flood-fills each group on a pasted board to print its stones and liberty count (flagging groups with 2 or fewer), and count.py flood-fills empty regions to tally area score with named dead stones. Both only analyze the current position and never choose, rank, or look ahead at moves.", "stop": false}}